      },
      "text_zh_tw": "敵方怪物有相當強的，要小心。每勝一場有獎金，全勝還有美好獎品，加油。",
      "text_cp950_bytes_len": 68,
      "text_cp950_hex": "bcc4a4e8a9c7aaaba6b3acdbb7edb16aaabaa141ad6ea470a4dfa143a843b3d3a440b3f5a6b3bcfaaaf7a141a5feb3d3c1d9a6b3acfca66ebcfaab7ea141a55baa6fa143",
